/// [C6-D12] The row gate: 1 on rows 0..=382, 0 from 383 on.
///
/// Emitted separately from C7's twin rather than aliased, so C6 does not
/// silently move if C7's mask is ever rebaked for a different FIRST_FREE_ROW.
/// They are bit-identical today and a drift pin asserts it, which turns that
/// identity into a signal instead of a coincidence.
