/// Poseidon rows, which already spend both of their two permitted periodic
/// factors on `not_boundary` and `round_flag`. Substituting the
/// pre-multiplied form keeps the count at two, so `ce_blowup_factor` stays
/// at 8 and the proof structure does not move. The chain constraint needs no
/// gate: its `chain_flag` is a one-hot at row 63, deep inside the witness
/// region and already zero everywhere the mask lives.
